WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.808
Hello! My name is Drizzle.

2
00:00:05.809 --> 00:00:09.305
I am a tiny water drop.

3
00:00:09.306 --> 00:00:11.974
Whew! The sun is heating me up!

4
00:00:11.975 --> 00:00:17.518
I am getting smaller and smaller.

5
00:00:17.519 --> 00:00:26.101
Oh! I am going up, up, up into a cloud! Whee!

6
00:00:26.102 --> 00:00:27.551
Look at them.

7
00:00:27.552 --> 00:00:31.742
They look just like me.

8
00:00:31.743 --> 00:00:34.293
It is really cool up here.

9
00:00:34.294 --> 00:00:37.524
I like this place.

10
00:00:37.525 --> 00:00:39.728
Hey! Look at me!

11
00:00:39.729 --> 00:00:42.975
I am getting bigger and bigger.

12
00:00:42.976 --> 00:00:46.731
Oh no! I am too big and heavy!

13
00:00:46.732 --> 00:00:50.387
I am falling from the sky!

14
00:00:50.388 --> 00:00:52.337
Where am I now?

15
00:00:52.338 --> 00:00:57.043
Oh! I am in a river.

16
00:00:57.044 --> 00:00:59.997
My friends are falling onto the ground.

17
00:00:59.998 --> 00:01:04.206
They are seeping into the ground.

18
00:01:04.207 --> 00:01:08.100
Now this river is moving fast!

19
00:01:08.101 --> 00:01:16.492
Oh no! A waterfall!

20
00:01:16.493 --> 00:01:18.779
What is this place?

21
00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:25.163
Oh! I am being cleaned!

22
00:01:25.164 --> 00:01:27.356
It's dark in here.

23
00:01:27.357 --> 00:01:30.425
Where am I going now?

24
00:01:30.426 --> 00:01:33.047
Ohh! "Splash!"

25
00:01:33.048 --> 00:01:38.073
Wow! Here I am again!

